Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1046-1047] Onigashima 46 - The Skies Above the Capital.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.17,0:01:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good to know you've still got\Nthat cocky side to ya, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:48.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When your mind and body catch up to your power,\Nthat's when Awakening happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And your power's\Njust plain ridiculous...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've already lost so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.86,0:02:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So much of the empire I built, gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My underlings, and the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,True, but I've got stuff\NI gotta take back from ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kundali Dragon Swarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya big dope!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:45.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Howzzat for ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every floor of the castle\Nbelow us is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure thousands of\Nyour soldiers are stuck there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they're all gonna\Nroast to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't sell 'em short, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:26.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I trusted 'em to take care of everything\Ngoin' on down there for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I did that so I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...focus on kickin' your ass sky-high!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The way you laugh pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demolition Gust!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:56.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1695,429)}Dome Interior\NPerformance Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:04:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not just the castle anymore!\NAll the towers are burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:03.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guyyyys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd everybody go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heeeey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.91,0:04:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!\NWe can't put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Sanji, Franky, Brook,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, Robin, and Jinbe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't found any of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They might be stuck in the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.39,0:04:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we went searching,\Nall of Onigashima's in flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here isn't safe, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless the island lands,\Nwe've got nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:49.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus, can't you use your rain\Nto put out the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:53.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In a fire like this?!\NI'd be baked crispy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all worked so hard\Nto get this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could it end like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all gonna be totally okay,\Nso no giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:11.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1607,183)}Castle Interior\NBasement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't escape!\NThe fire's everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not made for this heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1594,272)}1st\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's way too much work\Nto lug you around, Bepo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeooow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:42.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can\Nget out of this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save us, Captaaaain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:56.35,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1540,366)}Basement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:06:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My precious afro is becoming\Nmore curly by the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to not end up\Nlooking like you, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel your frustration!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To be reduced to that state...\NI don't know what to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My condolences to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:26.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must have been slow in escaping\Nand burned to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come now,\NI am no charred corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am dead though...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My goodness,\Nis the burning ever intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there isn't a way\Nfor all of us to escape, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:44.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1524,319)}Pleasure Hall\NLeft-Brain Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No go...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't escape from here\Nwith the courtyard gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:00.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The abyss to our front,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and hell's at our backs...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't even turn around\Nand head back, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nowhere to run\Nwhile we're midair...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fire, the collapsing castle,\Nand the ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, what to do then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1556,336)}Basement
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear, "It's hot!"\NBust down the damn wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless you'd rather die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just sacrifice one of your damn arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What use is that huge body\Nof yours anyway, dumbass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight, do ya,\Nyou moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.97,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1639,355)}Basement
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heat and the flames\Nhave put us in a pickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there a way for us to survive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we had a clue,\Nthis wouldn't be an issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heat will kill us\Nif we can't find a solution!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, do something, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put out this fire, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure-Kill Green Star:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sprinkler!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the very definition of\N"a drop in the bucket," my good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap! I gotta figure something out!\NI promised Izo, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna save Kin and Kiku...\Nand myself, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hueh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir, please include me as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:57.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1622,285)}Right-Brain\NTower
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The castle's burnin' outta control!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which way do we go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro's hangin' by a thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta get him to Chopper ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna be cooked\Nbefore that happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:15.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So hot, so hot!\NI just wanna survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help us, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.89,0:09:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's whinin' back there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make me\Nset ya on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:29.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1589,192)}Castle Interior\N3rd Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another dead end! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flames and debris\Nkeep getting in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did someone run around\Nsetting these fires?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Death by fire rather than by the hand of the enemy\Nis not the way I plan on going down in this raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some fight this turned out to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let\Nsome fire get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We're making it through this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:56.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:10:01.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1588,373)}Castle Interior\N4th Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am prepared, Jinbe-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:11.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am grateful for your trust in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy chose to ally\Nwith you and yours, Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What place has doubt here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:19.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come, do what you must!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:23.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall! If anything,\NI am the one placing my trust in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:28.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day,\NI have been prepared...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiyori-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make haste!\NHaste, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could not defend Oden-sama that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I allowed Momonosuke-sama\Nand the others to suffer in that inferno of a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:55.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even with my Ninja Arts,\NI could not save anybody then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A great blunder\Nfor which I must repent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:00.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never, ever want...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to feel that way again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:09.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis Zou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inuarashi, what manner of rain is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zunesha is bathing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What an incredible amount of water!\NMay I partake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not permit those that\Ntook part in this raid...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to die to these accursed flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have kept you waiting\Nfor too long, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:49.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall display water flowing in such ways\Nthat will leave you in disbelief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja Art: Scrolling Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Elephant's Bath —
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Restoration!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Massive, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Jujutsu:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ocean Current Shoulder Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fill every last bit of this castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be enough, waters of Zou,\Nto rescue us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1633,228)}Castle Interior\N1st Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me down, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta let us do\Nsomethin' for ya, Killer-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?!\NThere's actually nowhere else to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a rumble...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:21.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:25.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make haste, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why must I?! Kaido yet lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must keep this island afloat\Nwith your Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:54.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I, keep the island afloat?!\NAn impossible task!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido is surely close to his limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His Flame Clouds will not\Nlast much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must create Flame Clouds\Nto keep Onigashima in the skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehhhh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This was our only option\Nfrom the very start?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:19.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As things stand,\NOnigashima will plummet to the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Momonosuke-kun!\NCreate Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!\NJust out with the Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis easier said than done...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:02.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:05.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They will not come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:07.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:21.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go with Kin'emon\Nand the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are to leap\Ntwenty years into the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and return the Kozuki Clan\Nto greatness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then why will you and Hiyori\Nnot come with us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your mother's suffering is\Ngreater than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the land of samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where shame alone could end your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For a man to complain\Nafter a woman has set her resolve...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is mortal shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am but a child...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With all due respect,\Nas Oden-sama is no longer with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you are no longer an ordinary child!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:20.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are the son of a great samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And one day, you will lead our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you would allow me to be so forward...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you permit us\None more chance to fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I am going to burn to death regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then I would die wielding my blade\Nin the name of my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prithee would you give us\Nthe chance to die as samurai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:24.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:28.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However you can, live...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am too ashamed to face Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am no longer some ordinary child!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:59.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the man that will be\NShogun of this land!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will save our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halt, Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, not that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that way!\NNot toward the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:38.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're tellin' me you can grab lightning?!\NWhatta load of bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.59,0:18:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, his power is bull...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, ya little jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can play around...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit power\Nwill never conquer the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:03.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing, how things work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:08.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like how Roger\Nnever ate a Devil Fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only Haki...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can transcend all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:19.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Destroyer of Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:25.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We send to those\Nthat have passed on...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Release your sky lantern boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.65,0:22:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:07.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes!\NSteady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The festival's end draws near...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we return to\Nlaboring as slaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.83,0:22:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope I can live to see another year...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.63,0:22:31.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reach my Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:55.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell're you tryin'\Nto do to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.12,0:22:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, leggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:23:00.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you're doin' is\Ngiving away your location!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demolition Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:12.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bet you're still wide open to\Ncutting attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:19.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.77,0:23:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.21,0:23:49.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, it came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.97,0:23:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some kind of tremor\Npulled the Sea Prism Stone nail out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.85,0:24:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.48,0:24:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least I can take you down with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you watching, Oden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.45,0:24:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.20,0:24:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dies with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.63,0:24:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kingpin Hyogoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:31.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard Onigashima's plummeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means he's cornered Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me, men!\NWhich would you rather?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.22,0:24:43.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the Straw Hat Man takes Kaido down,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.52,0:24:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we fall, and we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.94,0:24:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it means Kaido wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.03,0:24:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, the choice is simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.66,0:25:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a kid in Hakumai.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.16,0:25:04.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a wife in Ringo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Kaido goes down,\Nour families live happily ever after!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.54,0:25:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be something?\NHell of a country ours would be then!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.88,0:25:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you damn samurai lost your minds?!\NThat'd mean you all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.80,0:25:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just as well, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.77,0:25:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.56,0:25:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat Kaido back to where he belongs!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.08,0:25:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!\NI don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.54,0:25:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, hot, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.96,0:25:49.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna diiiie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna survive no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.88,0:25:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.62,0:26:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halt, Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.91,0:26:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heeey! Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.26,0:26:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm finishing this, right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.97,0:26:47.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima's in my way!\NMove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.57,0:26:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is as if he intends to punch\Nstraight through Onigashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.36,0:26:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.99,0:26:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uwhoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.45,0:27:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy!\NI still cannot...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.78,0:27:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.04,0:27:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I trust ya!
